{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-38","kind":"proposition","title":"等底同高三角形面积相等","englishTitle":"Triangles which are on equal bases and in the same parallels are equal to one another.","book":1,"number":38,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.38","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.38/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":38,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-38@raw-28adbf70b25842dc","contentId":"euclid-1-38","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"28adbf70b25842dc96dad1ce7abeed631c3fe79681fce0ee81c4bdb8c2b21154","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-38.statement","euclid-1-38.construction.1","euclid-1-38.construction.2","euclid-1-38.proof.1","euclid-1-38.proof.2","euclid-1-38.proof.3","euclid-1-38.proof.4","euclid-1-38.proof.5","euclid-1-38.proof.6","euclid-1-38.proof.7","euclid-1-38.conclusion","euclid-1-38.historical.1","euclid-1-38.historical.2","euclid-1-38.historical.3","euclid-1-38.historical.4","euclid-1-38.historical.5","euclid-1-38.historical.6","euclid-1-38.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-38.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-38","revisionId":"euclid-1-38@raw-28adbf70b25842dc","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b3e2786c1d9f9696c1b165797cb8027866dd7b3f0b890d39d71a2b3abbd01d9f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Triangles which are on equal bases and in the same parallels are equal to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"底边和底边等量的三角形是相同的。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两平行线内有两三角形若底等则两形必等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两条平行线内的两个三角形；如果底边相等，那么这两个图形必须相等"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-38.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-38","revisionId":"euclid-1-38@raw-28adbf70b25842dc","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a8f1a64b4e4d272e029ecb911ea5c0f217073a5ab55fcec615b7b79d63da4b1f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABC, DEF be triangles on equal bases BC, EF and in the same parallels BF, AD; I say that the triangle ABC is equal to the triangle DEF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABC,DEF成为三角形, 等于底边,BC,EF, 并同时是BF,AD; 我说三角形ABC等于三角形DEF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-38.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-1-38","revisionId":"euclid-1-38@raw-28adbf70b25842dc","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"980a586fd560d4a8f76e9185c008721dec844aa5918dbc001cce96e52fb7e3bf","citations":["euclid-1-31"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let AD be produced in both directions to G, H; through B let BG be drawn parallel to CA, [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)] and through F let FH be drawn parallel to DE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将AD扩大到G,H;将B扩大到CA,将BG扩大到BG,将F扩大到FH,将DE分配给FH。 [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-38.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-38","revisionId":"euclid-1-38@raw-28adbf70b25842dc","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"43983b3af1718d2f40acffb657649cb2cc4aa00d38836b05a5a1e1d5bd58baaa","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then each of the figures GBCA, DEFH is a parallelogram; and GBCA is equal to DEFH;"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"GBCA,DEFH是平行四边形,GBCA等于DEFH;"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-38.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-38","revisionId":"euclid-1-38@raw-28adbf70b25842dc","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"28d2bca21ca35dcf834be4703d3eb1a5435b982305ca0197eb0758cf80f805ad","citations":["euclid-1-36"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"for they are on equal bases BC, EF and in the same parallels BF, GH. [[I. 36](/principles/euclid-1-36)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为它们在底边 BC,EF之间,在相同时间,BF,GH。 [[I. 36](/principles/euclid-1-36)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-38.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-38","revisionId":"euclid-1-38@raw-28adbf70b25842dc","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9b31667f2d54f005e86bc85f630a3285d6d3d8f0f9ee74e93a0f468ed038ab3c","citations":["euclid-1-34"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Moreover the triangle ABC is half of the parallelogram GBCA; for the diameter AB bisects it. [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"此外,三角形ABC是平行四边形 GBCA的一半;对角线为AB两部分。 [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-38.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-38","revisionId":"euclid-1-38@raw-28adbf70b25842dc","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"acad0adf39a3d8ed6e2362da0fa9e3658f218ec2fe2a27b8cf0857eeb1e9466b","citations":["euclid-1-34"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the triangle FED is half of the parallelogram DEFH; for the diameter DF bisects it. [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"三角形FED是平行四边形 DEFH的一半,对角线DF的两部分是它。 [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-38.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-1-38","revisionId":"euclid-1-38@raw-28adbf70b25842dc","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"67f66e71a66e9ce526d9890cd72e1ae85146fc3c2f02174bda5188330a826a96","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"[But the halves of equal things are equal to one another.]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"万物的分界线,是相等的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-38.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-1-38","revisionId":"euclid-1-38@raw-28adbf70b25842dc","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ee6a58dcaaa8c4b97bcd3aee45a7782eac7e63e945360ebef0c689e0077471f3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the triangle ABC is equal to the triangle DEF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此三角形ABC等于三角形DEF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-38.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-1-38","revisionId":"euclid-1-38@raw-28adbf70b25842dc","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-38.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-38","revisionId":"euclid-1-38@raw-28adbf70b25842dc","order":10,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a767bacf26447ac75c1864eb85eb90c16406ee2f0184be6b8ee076c3e1a38d5c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-38.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-38","revisionId":"euclid-1-38@raw-28adbf70b25842dc","order":11,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"04c838daddd1fb7b350721580fdbbbcf46f2fb6ab375181fa92a54cad136d7d9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两平行线内有两三角形若底等则两形必等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两条平行线内的两个三角形；如果底边相等，那么这两个图形必须相等"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-38.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-38","revisionId":"euclid-1-38@raw-28adbf70b25842dc","order":12,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6e258c064e1552c5688bf5542e0303ab22282739f2d523ff8eff5b23267a044b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"解曰：甲乙丙丁两平行线内有甲丙戊与乙己丁两角形而丙戊与己丁两底等题言两形必等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"解释如下：在两条平行线 :甲乙丙丁 之间，有三角形 甲丙戊 和 乙己丁，而 丙戊 和 己丁 有两个底边，相等。命题说明这两个图形必须相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-38.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-1-38","revisionId":"euclid-1-38@raw-28adbf70b25842dc","order":13,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c954dee6dd0c57462887a9471f0441f98ab4b3b18c38c4117416e925b7b98858","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：试自庚至戊辛至丁各作直线与甲丙乙己平行〈本篇卅一〉其甲丙戊庚与乙己丁辛两平行方形既等〈本篇卅六〉则甲丙戊与乙己丁两角形为两方形之半者〈本篇卅四〉亦等〈公论七〉増凡角形任于一边两平分之向对角作直线即分本形为两平分"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：从 庚 到 戊辛 再到 丁 画一条线，与 甲丙乙己 平行。〈本篇卅一〉，如果两个平行四边形 甲丙戊庚 和 乙己丁辛 相等，那么三角形 甲丙戊 和 乙己丁 是两个正方形的一半，因此 〈本篇卅四〉 也等于 〈公论七〉。一般来说，任何通过对角线画直线来平分一边的三角形，都相当于平分主形状。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-38.historical.4","contentId":"euclid-1-38","revisionId":"euclid-1-38@raw-28adbf70b25842dc","order":14,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"32adf531806225cb643f81757bc6b2e2451f94ca56b89e75cb9e3df0b2e7efd8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：甲乙丙角形试以乙丙边两平分于丁〈本篇十〉自丁至甲作直线即甲丁线分本形为两平分何者试于甲角上作直线与乙丙平行〈本篇卅一〉则甲乙丁甲丁丙两角形在两平行线内两底等两形亦等〈本题〉二増题凡角形任于一边任作一点求从点分本形为两平分"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：甲乙丙 三角形，尝试在 丁〈本篇十〉 处平分边 乙丙，从 丁 到 甲 画一条直线，即 甲丁 线平分原形状。平分三角形的意义是什么？在 甲 角处画一条与 乙丙 平行的线。〈本篇卅一〉 然后 甲乙丁甲丁丙 两个三角形的底边在两条平行线内时相等。〈本题〉 补充问题：对于任意三角形，在一边的任意一点，发现从该点可以平分原形状。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-38.historical.5","contentId":"euclid-1-38","revisionId":"euclid-1-38@raw-28adbf70b25842dc","order":15,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"56440aa2276b266fa93a0a74ab19b7f97a6cd0a6f3dfc361517618d0aa9f0027","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"法曰：甲乙丙角形从丁点求两平分先自丁至相对甲角作甲丁直线次平分乙丙线于戊〈本篇十〉作戊己线与甲丁平行〈本篇卅一〉末作己丁直线即分本形为两平分"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"绘图方法如下：甲乙丙，从 丁 点找到三角形的平分线。首先，从 丁 到对角 甲 画一条线 甲丁，画 甲丁 线的二次平分线，画 乙丙 线，画与 甲丁 在 戊〈本篇十〉 处平行的 戊己 线，在 〈本篇卅一〉 末端画 线，画 己丁 线，从而平分原形状。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-38.historical.6","contentId":"euclid-1-38","revisionId":"euclid-1-38@raw-28adbf70b25842dc","order":16,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"aec8307f995951770a51d9e1a0d4d129e6263897ca0491d38c77e9854eeb6af0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：试作甲戊直线即甲戊己己丁戊两角形在两平行线内同己戊底者等而每加一己戊丙形则己丁丙与甲戊丙两角形亦等〈公论二〉夫甲戊丙为甲乙丙之半〈本题増〉则己丁丙亦甲乙丙之半"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：构造一条线 甲戊，即 甲戊己己丁戊 和两条平行线内的两个三角形。如果 己戊 的底边相等且加上 己戊丙，那么三角形 己丁丙 和 甲戊丙 也相等。〈公论二〉 和 甲戊丙 是 甲乙丙 的一半，〈本题増〉 也是 甲乙丙 的一半。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-38.source","contentId":"euclid-1-38","revisionId":"euclid-1-38@raw-28adbf70b25842dc","order":17,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"77f2e22a47d133c8eb42aff3149e7d7576a1edc057893163fab48496710fdddb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.38/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.38\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-1-38:euclid-1-31:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-38","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-38.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-31","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.38","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.pe